[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:10.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:15.00]left a single note and went on their way
[00:20.18]I never got their name until the credits
[00:24.48]now it plays here every single day
[00:29.76]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:39.80]One note at a time
[00:43.50]from people passing through
[00:47.18]a name beside a line
[00:51.24]and part of it is you
[00:56.44]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
